      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature attempts a melee attack against a zombie grindylow with a bludgeoning or slashing weapon</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature must succeed at a DC 15 Reflex save saving throw or become tangled in the kelp that surrounds the zombie grindylow, giving the creature a -10 circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it spends a manipulate action to remove the kelp.</p>",
